THE CORE IDEA
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

A stack is the right tool when:
→ You need to PAIR or MATCH something seen earlier with something now.
→ You need to WAIT for a future element before processing a past one.
→ You need to UNDO or REVERSE recent decisions.

Ask yourself: "Do I need to look back at the most recent unmatched item?"
→ YES → use a stack.

