THERE ARE 4 TYPES OF STACK PROBLEMS ON LEETCODE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

TYPE 1 — BRACKET MATCHING → validate or fix parentheses
TYPE 2 — MONOTONIC STACK → next greater/smaller, histograms
TYPE 3 — EXPRESSION EVAL → calculators, reverse polish notation
TYPE 4 — STACK SIMULATION → process elements that affect each other

