━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Bracket matching → push open, pop and check on close
Unmatched brackets → push indices, remaining stack = unmatched
Next greater element → decreasing stack, pop when current > top
Next smaller element → increasing stack, pop when current < top
Histogram / rain water → increasing stack of indices, pop on smaller bar
RPN evaluation → push numbers, apply operator on two pops
Infix with * / → defer + -, compute * / immediately
Nested decode/expand → push state on open bracket, restore on close
Elements cancel each other → push/pop cancel pairs, stack = survivors
O(1) min with stack → second stack tracking min at each level
